title: 竞技场魔法书与技能触发
tags: 竞技场技能触发 AI生成

!! 魔法书与游戏效果配方

行动规则可以直接调用角色身上可用的技能 id，例如 `blink` 或 `strike`。技能源码内部包含咏唱代码；咏唱代码提交签名链后，游戏运行时根据签名链模式匹配对应的游戏效果。

魔法书是图书馆中的掉落物品，记载特定技能可匹配的游戏效果配方。玩家在游戏内找到魔法书后，得知某个技能的咏唱代码需要提交怎样的签名链模式，才能让游戏运行时匹配到对应效果。

```ts
export interface Spellbook {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  skillId: string;
  triggerRecipes: TriggerRecipe[];
  discovered: boolean;
}
```

!! 游戏效果配方

配方定义游戏运行时需要在签名链中匹配的连续片段：

```ts
export interface TriggerRecipe {
  id: string;
  description: string;
  requiredSequences: SequenceConstraint[];
  optionalEffects: SequenceConstraint[];
}

export interface SequenceConstraint {
  id: string;
  repeat: number;
  sequence: WatermarkKind[];
  constraints: PatternConstraints;
}
```

示例：闪现技能的游戏效果配方

```ts
const blinkRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'blinkMobility',
  description: '短距离空间跃迁',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'baseActivation',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        contiguous: true,
        pipelineConsumesObserverOutput: true,
        decoratorConsumesPipelineOutput: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'shorterPreparation',
      repeat: 3,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        contiguous: true,
        distinctEventWindows: true,
        distinctDecoratorSlots: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'longerRange',
      repeat: 2,
      sequence: ['factoryMethod', 'pipeline', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        distinctFactorySources: true,
        pipelineStepsMustDiffer: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'cooldownReduction',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['stateMachine', 'commandTrace', 'repository', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        stateMustAdvance: true,
        commandMustBeReplayable: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};
```

!! 赛周新增配方

每赛周可能新增魔法书，记载新技能或已有技能的新触发方式。已有的常用技能保持稳定，不会全局随机调整。

```ts
// 赛周新增：碰撞后爆炸
const collisionExplosionRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'collisionExplosion',
  description: 'projectile 碰撞后触发范围爆炸',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'collisionDetection',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['observer'],
      constraints: {
        eventTopic: 'projectileCollision',
        distinctEventWindows: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'largerBlast',
      repeat: 2,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        eventTopic: 'areaDamage',
        distinctEventWindows: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};

// 延时爆炸
const delayedExplosionRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'delayedExplosion',
  description: '命中目标后延时触发爆炸',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'fuseArming',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['stateMachine', 'commandTrace', 'pipeline'],
      constraints: {
        stateMustAdvance: true,
        commandMustBeReplayable: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'shorterFuse',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['pipeline', 'decorator', 'pipeline'],
      constraints: {
        pipelineStepsMustDiffer: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'largerBlastRadius',
      repeat: 2,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        eventTopic: 'areaDamage',
        distinctDecoratorSlots: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};

// 自分裂（分裂弹）
const splitProjectileRecipe: TriggerRecipe = {
  id: 'splitProjectile',
  description: 'projectile 按弹道分裂为多个子弹',
  requiredSequences: [
    {
      id: 'splitBase',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['factoryMethod', 'pipeline', 'pipeline'],
      constraints: {
        pipelineStepsMustDiffer: true,
        distinctFactorySources: true,
      },
    },
  ],
  optionalEffects: [
    {
      id: 'moreSplits',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['factoryMethod', 'composite', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        distinctFactorySources: true,
      },
    },
    {
      id: 'widerSpread',
      repeat: 1,
      sequence: ['observer', 'pipeline', 'decorator'],
      constraints: {
        distinctDecoratorSlots: true,
      },
    },
  ],
};

配方中的 `sequence` 字段使用设计模式水印，对应关系详见[[竞技场咏唱设计模式]]。技能事件 key 和环境状态查询的咏唱过程接口实现细节，详见[[竞技场咏唱核心]]。

